    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan War Chess is visually striking with immersive gameplay with custom chess pieces. Each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >map has its own design theme. There are animated and traditional chess pieces and can be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >played against AI or battle it out with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the over-board view you can move around and get up close to the battle action taking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan War Chess to the next level with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Play against a world leading AI, Stockfish 16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Battle against your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Free movement around the board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Enjoy different environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Animated and Traditional Pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Visual effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Easy for both new and experienced player to learn and enjoy the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the power of Unreal Engine 5 and Stockfish 16 AI makes it challenging in Player vs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan War Chess take the realism of chess and striking visuals to create a casual chess game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that you can take your time and enjoy the chess experience with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP is Coming Soon and will be updated as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first game so please be kind :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan War Chess is visually striking with immersive gameplay with custom chess pieces. Each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >map has its own design theme. There are animated and traditional chess pieces and can be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >played against AI or battle it out with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the over-board view you can move around and get up close to the battle action taking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan War Chess to the next level with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Play against a world leading AI, Stockfish 16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Battle against your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Free movement around the board</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Enjoy different environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Animated and Traditional Pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Visual effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uf0b7 Easy for both new and experienced player to learn and enjoy the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the power of Unreal Engine 5 and Stockfish 16 AI makes it challenging in Player vs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clan War Chess take the realism of chess and striking visuals to create a casual chess game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that you can take your time and enjoy the chess experience with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP is Coming Soon and will be updated as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first game so please be kind :)</p>",
